# 127 - aegis-desktop-ntp-brand (r66 test F2' follow-up)
# The NTP logo element always painted icons/google_logo.svg (Google
# wordmark) and the realbox static placeholder fell back to the
# stock "Search Google or type a URL" hint string, even though the
# DSE is Aegis Search (verified in r66: settings + real search go to
# the aegis worker). Replace the glyph with an aegis shield+wordmark
# and make the placeholder fallback engine-neutral.
#   chrome/browser/resources/new_tab_page/icons/google_logo.svg
#     -> aegis shield + lowercase wordmark (mask-friendly monochrome)
#   ui/webui/resources/cr_components/searchbox/searchbox_input.ts
#     -> i18n('searchBoxHint') fallback -> 'Search or type a URL'
